OL,3,GNEWSAHow has Karl Bushby's home city
OL,4,Achanged over 28 years?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs Karl Bushby made his way through
OL,7,FHull for the first time since 1998, he
OL,8,Fgot a little bit lost around Hessle
OL,9,FRoad.
OL,11,F"We've gone a little off route," he
OL,12,Fjoked as he took a shortcut through
OL,13,FAsda's car park ` a supermarket that
OL,14,Fwasn't even built when he set off
OL,15,Fnearly three decades earlier.
OL,17,FIt was the final few miles of an epic
OL,18,Fadventure that saw him walk more than
OL,19,F31,000 miles (58,000km) across four
OL,20,Fcontinents and swim the English
OL,21,FChannel.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
