OL,3,GNEWSAHow has Karl Bushby's home city
OL,4,Achanged over 28 years?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA few years after he set off, Hull was
OL,7,Fbeing touted as the worst city in the
OL,8,FUK. But in 2025, it was crowned one of
OL,9,Fthe world's most desirable tourist
OL,10,Fdestinations by National Geographic.
